  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop a stronger basis of knowledge and evidence that can improve the effectiveness and impact of development programmes in DFID priority countries, through the funding of discrete research projects. Research projects range from reviewing evidence of community driven reconstruction/development to mapping research institutions in Africa.</narrative>
